WEBVTT

00:09:58.594 --> 00:10:00.888
and asking him again and again,
and he responded

00:10:00.929 --> 00:10:03.182
and he went deeper and deeper.

00:10:03.223 --> 00:10:05.434
And it started a chain
of people who were like,

00:10:05.476 --> 00:10:07.728
"Let's get this tattoo out of his face."

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:11.857
So now before we revealed
the image that you saw,

00:10:11.857 --> 00:10:14.193
I didn't want to throw it
to the world like that.

00:10:14.193 --> 00:10:16.487
For now, only the inmates
and I have seen it.

00:10:16.528 --> 00:10:18.989
We started an app
where you can actually go in,

00:10:19.031 --> 00:10:20.366
it's totally free,

00:10:20.366 --> 00:10:23.452
and you can go and click
on any face and hear their story

00:10:23.494 --> 00:10:24.828
for as much as they want.

00:10:25.245 --> 00:10:31.502
(Applause)